  "description": "Retro style, classic simplicity. The OLD SKOOL® Men's Beach Cruiser is built for riders who want the timeless look of a vintage cruiser with the comfort and quality of a modern HBBC build. The custom pedal-forward cruiser frame puts you in a natural, upright riding position — comfortable to ride and impossible to ignore.Single-speed coaster brake keeps things pure and reliable — just pedal, cruise, and enjoy. 26\" x 50mm aluminum wheels with black stainless spokes, retro smooth ride cruiser tires, and the HBBC quilted gel comfort seat make this the ultimate all-day cruiser. At HBBC, we take making the best beach cruiser bikes for men seriously — designing and manufacturing every product with quality and comfort as our top priority.Customize your ride with our bike accessories, or go further with our Electric Beach Cruisers.HBBC… Style Matters… Ride With Us!!Check out the entire OLD SKOOL® family of cruisers! Visit our flagship store — HB Easyrider at 328 Main Street in Downtown Huntington Beach!🛠️ Specs",
